# Cast — the Glitchers (hidden resistance)
#
# The underground railroad out of the Internet. A Glitch contact works the
# cells; Hacker_Zero hands out the tools; a VPN node hides your trail. The
# faction stays a rumour until the first guest actually escapes (ROLE Guest
# `on escape` reveals it). Each is a `GlitcherScanner(beat)` (badge + router).

CHARACTER Glitch is GlitcherScanner(glitch_offer)
CHARACTER Hacker_Zero is GlitcherScanner(hacker_tool)
CHARACTER VPN_Node is GlitcherScanner(vpn_connect)
